## 8. Validation plan

| Check | Method | Pass rule |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Count parity | Source count at snapshot vs. canonical rows vs. records_imported vs. namespace stats, re-read until stable | Equal after subtracting rejects and adding duplicates loaded via upsert |
| Vector fidelity | Fetch {{ mapping.validation.fidelity_sample }} random ids and compare with the source vector | Cosine >= 0.9999 per record |
| Metadata fidelity | Same sample, field by field after the mapped transform | 100% equal |
| Recall@{{ mapping.validation.recall_at_k.k }} | {{ mapping.validation.recall_at_k.queries }} queries from stored vectors; ground truth is exact kNN ({{ "script_score with knn_score" if inventory.kind == "opensearch" else "index scans disabled" }}) | Mean recall >= {{ mapping.validation.recall_at_k.threshold }} |
| Filter parity | 20 queries with the most common metadata filters | Same result set as the source at k |
| Id diff | Full id set from source vs. index.list per namespace | Zero missing, zero extra |

